# Add patterns of files dvc should ignore, which could improve
# the performance. Learn more at
# https://dvc.org/doc/user-guide/dvcignore

# Python writes these cache files into code folders whenever it runs. They are
# not code: if DVC saw them, any folder listed as a dependency would look
# "changed" after every run and its pipeline step would re-run for nothing.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
